# Advance Orders (remember)

## Goal
Advance Collection/Delivery (`ScheduledTime`) get a **3h** kitchen auto-print (+ popup), and Manager **Advance Orders** list (SharedUI) on Mother + Client.

## Phase 0 — product rules (LOCKED)

| Rule | Locked value |
|--|--|
| Lead time | **3 hours** before `ScheduledTime` (v1 fixed) |
| Inside window on create/send | `ScheduledTime − now ≤ 3h` → kitchen print now (once) |
| Outside window | Wait until **T−3h** → kitchen print (once) (+ popup) |
| ASAP (no date/time) | No advance reminder / no advance auto-print |
| Print label | Collection → `Collection time:` · Delivery → `Delivery time:` |
| Print once | `advance_kitchen_printed_at` — never double-print on restart |
| Popup | Till card: type · time · customer · # · Open / Dismiss / Print now |
| Who sees popup | Mother + online Client (Mother owns clock) |
| Manager list | SharedUI Advance Orders — Admin/Manager Mother + Manager Client |
| List filters v1 | Today / Tomorrow / Next 7 days |
| Architecture | Mother timer + DB + print · Client → Mother · SharedUI chrome |
| Source of truth | Local POS orders with `ScheduledTime` (Collection/Delivery) |

### Explicit non-goals (v1)
- No SMS · no lead-time settings UI · no Client→cloud · no offline Client scheduler
- No auto-print at create when `ScheduledTime` is **> 3h** away
- No rider dispatch from this screen
- No quiet hours

## Build order
0. **Phase 0** — lock rules ✅
1. **Phase 1** — Data + Mother scheduler core ✅
2. **Phase 2** — Contracts + Client API + WS `advance.reminder` ✅
3. **Phase 3** — SharedUI AdvanceOrdersView + reminder dialog ✅
4. **Phase 4** — Mother Manager host + till popup ✅
5. **Phase 5** — Client Manager host + WS popup ✅
