7. Phase 7 — QA checklist ← NEXT

## Phase 1 — Data + Mother scheduler (done)
- Columns: `advance_kitchen_printed_at`, `advance_reminded_at`
- `AdvanceOrderService`: ListUpcoming / GetDue / MarkPrinted / ProcessDue (print once)
- Background job `advance-order-kitchen-scheduler` ~45s, MotherOnly
- Due when `ScheduledTime ≤ now + 3h`, not void/paid, has items, not yet printed
- Kitchen via `PrintTakeawayOrderAsync` (items as NotSent for ticket)

**Done when:** +4h order waits until T−3h; +1h prints next tick; restart no reprint.

## Phase 2 — Contracts + Client API (done)

### HTTP
- `GET /api/client/advance-orders?range=today|tomorrow|7d` → `AdvanceOrderListResponseDto`
- `POST /api/client/advance-orders/{orderId}/print-kitchen` → `AdvanceOrderPrintResponseDto`
- Gate: Client **Manager** session + Collection|Delivery|LiveOrders feature
- DTOs: `OrderWeb.Contracts/Dtos/AdvanceOrderContracts.cs`
- Client HTTP: `MotherAdvanceOrderClient` (`ListAsync` / `PrintKitchenAsync`), online-only `ClientOperation.AdvanceOrders`

### WS `advance.reminder`
Mother fan-out + `terminal_events` payload (`AdvanceOrderReminderDto`):
`orderId`, `orderNumber`, `orderType`, `scheduledTimeUtc`, `scheduledDisplay`, `customerName`, `customerPhone`, `totalAmount`, `kitchenPrinted`
Fired from `AdvanceOrderService` after successful once-print (`PublishAdvanceReminderAsync`).

**Done when:** test tool can hit list API; WS payload documented on DTO.

## Phase 3 — SharedUI chrome (done)
- `AdvanceOrdersView` — title, Today/Tomorrow/Next 7 days chips, rows, empty “No advance orders”, Print kitchen + row tap events, `ShowSampleData()`
- `AdvanceOrderReminderDialog` — Open order / Dismiss / Print kitchen now; busy guard
- No HTTP inside SharedUI

**Done when:** `ShowSampleData()` + dialog stub work without host HTTP.

## Phase 4 — Mother hosts (done)
- Sidebar/route `advanceorders` → `AdvanceOrdersPage` hosts SharedUI; loads `AdvanceOrderService` locally
- `AdvanceOrderReminderPresenter` shows SharedUI dialog on MainThread after scheduler print
- Open → Order Place; Print → manual kitchen; Dismiss; print fail keeps dialog / list status

## Phase 5 — Client hosts (done)
- Manager menu Advance Orders → SharedUI + `MotherAdvanceOrderClient`
- WS `advance.reminder` → SharedUI dialog on MainPage
- Open order online; Print → Mother print endpoint
- Offline refuse (“Mother offline”)

## Phase 6 — Edge cases (done)
- Void/paid excluded from due set (GetDue filter) — no false print
- `ScheduledTime` change on `UpdateOrderAsync` clears `advance_kitchen_printed_at` / `advance_reminded_at`
- One Mother print; many till popups OK
- Soft note when ≥5 pending today on list

